  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 802.09 Biosolids",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 802.09 “Biosolids” means “biosolids” as defined in RSA 485-A:2, XXII, namely “any sludge derived from a sewage wastewater treatment facility that meets the standards for beneficial reuse specified by the department.”\n\nSource. #10998, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14571, eff 5-15-26, EXPIRES: 5-15-36 (formerly Env-Wq 802.08)",
